        "value": "人員 四万八千七百三十六人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Total population: 48,736 persons. This column starts one character higher than its neighbours, as the 戸數 column does. The total is corroborated by the status counts: 44,059 commoners + 316 temple + 19 yamabushi + 45 eta (facing page 124R) + 2,037 shizoku + 2,184 sotsu + 76 shrine staff = 48,736 exactly. The male and female runs printed beneath it do not sum to it — see the 人員男 entry."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "人員"
      }
